			"Message": "style(Worker): Normalize em-quad spacing and format ESBuild config\n\nFix the README heading to use `&#x2001;` (em-quad) between the title and gear emoji, aligning with the project's heading formatting convention for consistent spacing between text and emoji indicators.\n\nFormat Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js by adding blank-line separators between each export property, statement, and control-flow block. This improves vertical readability of the ESBuild configuration object without altering any values or behavior.",
